    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOIN OUR DISCORD COMMUNITY FOR DEVELOPMENT UPDATES!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Museum Simulator! In this game, you will organize, manage, and expand your own museum. Earn more money by increasing ticket prices and selling items in your gift shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some of the things you can do to increase your Museum's prestige:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/5595ac591e5ade13f75b3dd5917e8576.poster.avif?t=1753797475\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/5595ac591e5ade13f75b3dd5917e8576.webm?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/5595ac591e5ade13f75b3dd5917e8576.mp4?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Unknow</strong>n: Send expeditions to find relics of varying rarities, including some that have never been seen before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reveal the Relics</strong>: Once the expedition boxes arrive, you will need to clean the relics before placing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/7a8cf2aba280cddc3cd1ae3f60531a41.poster.avif?t=1753797475\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/7a8cf2aba280cddc3cd1ae3f60531a41.webm?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/7a8cf2aba280cddc3cd1ae3f60531a41.mp4?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curate</strong>: Choose where to place the relics based on their type, rarity, origin, or any way you want! The rarer the relics you have placed, the more customers will be willing to pay to come to your museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/ffe832b27b5e24079ba992924950cb10.poster.avif?t=1753797475\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/ffe832b27b5e24079ba992924950cb10.webm?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/ffe832b27b5e24079ba992924950cb10.mp4?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auction</strong>: If you find a relic that you already have or that is of no interest to you, you can simply auction it off for some extra cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/9c18cb6918af5bd3ba79d92785b254b0.poster.avif?t=1753797475\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/9c18cb6918af5bd3ba79d92785b254b0.webm?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/9c18cb6918af5bd3ba79d92785b254b0.mp4?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run a Gift Shop</strong>: Don't just wait to make money with tickets, sell some museum-themed merch in order to make an extra buck or two.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Your Collection</strong>: Can you find more than 350 custom-made relics?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a lover of history, a fan of cozy sims, or a completionist at heart, Museum Simulator offers a satisfying journey of discovery, design, and curation.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOIN OUR DISCORD COMMUNITY FOR DEVELOPMENT UPDATES!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Museum Simulator! In this game, you will organize, manage, and expand your own museum. Earn more money by increasing ticket prices and selling items in your gift shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some of the things you can do to increase your Museum's prestige:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/5595ac591e5ade13f75b3dd5917e8576.poster.avif?t=1753797475\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/5595ac591e5ade13f75b3dd5917e8576.webm?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/5595ac591e5ade13f75b3dd5917e8576.mp4?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Unknow</strong>n: Send expeditions to find relics of varying rarities, including some that have never been seen before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reveal the Relics</strong>: Once the expedition boxes arrive, you will need to clean the relics before placing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/7a8cf2aba280cddc3cd1ae3f60531a41.poster.avif?t=1753797475\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/7a8cf2aba280cddc3cd1ae3f60531a41.webm?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/7a8cf2aba280cddc3cd1ae3f60531a41.mp4?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curate</strong>: Choose where to place the relics based on their type, rarity, origin, or any way you want! The rarer the relics you have placed, the more customers will be willing to pay to come to your museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/ffe832b27b5e24079ba992924950cb10.poster.avif?t=1753797475\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/ffe832b27b5e24079ba992924950cb10.webm?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/ffe832b27b5e24079ba992924950cb10.mp4?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auction</strong>: If you find a relic that you already have or that is of no interest to you, you can simply auction it off for some extra cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/9c18cb6918af5bd3ba79d92785b254b0.poster.avif?t=1753797475\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/9c18cb6918af5bd3ba79d92785b254b0.webm?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654550/extras/9c18cb6918af5bd3ba79d92785b254b0.mp4?t=1753797475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run a Gift Shop</strong>: Don't just wait to make money with tickets, sell some museum-themed merch in order to make an extra buck or two.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Your Collection</strong>: Can you find more than 350 custom-made relics?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a lover of history, a fan of cozy sims, or a completionist at heart, Museum Simulator offers a satisfying journey of discovery, design, and curation.</p>",
